// Erie County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (Probate Court, the Clerk's
// case search, the Board of Elections and Ritter Public Library) were checked in a
// browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The July Board of Elections link (elections.erie.gov) was Erie County, NEW
//     YORK. The Ohio board is boe.ohio.gov/erie (2900 Columbus Ave.).
//   * The July parcel viewer (augis.eriecounty.oh.gov) now redirects to an empty
//     ArcGIS shell; the Auditor's GIS, Maps & FEMA page replaces it.
//   * The health department moved to eriehealthohio.com.
//   * eriecountyedc.org redirects to the Greater Sandusky Partnership
//     (greatersandusky.com).
//   * Huron City Schools moved to huronk12.org; Vermilion city is at
//     cityofvermilionohio.gov.
//   * Stein Hospice is now Reserve Care's Stein Hospice Center.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Erie County NEW YORK (erie.gov) and PENNSYLVANIA (Erie Community Foundation,
//   ymcaerie.org). ymcafremont.org and the Humane Society of Sandusky County are
//   Sandusky County. Huron County vs the City of Huron. Put-in-Bay and Marblehead
//   are Ottawa County. oldwomancreek.org and ohioshipwrecks.org now carry spam.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * Cities: Sandusky (seat), Huron and Vermilion (partly Lorain). Villages Bay
//     View, Berlin Heights, Castalia, Kelleys Island and Milan (partly Huron).
//     Eight of nine townships have sites (Groton has none).
//   * Four municipal courts: Erie County (Milan), Sandusky, Huron, Vermilion.
//   * 9-1-1 is the Sheriff's Dispatch Center; water and sewer are the Department
//     of Environmental Services. All three cities use RITA for income tax.
//   * The Kelleys Island car ferry leaves from Marblehead (Ottawa County).
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Port authorities (Erie County, Huron Joint): audit reports only, no sites.
//   * Big Brothers Big Sisters of Erie County and the old Boys & Girls Club site:
//     domains no longer resolve.
//   * Sandusky Area YMCA, Vermilion History Museum, Sheldon Marsh: no own sites.

